          "It is as though, in traveling, I see the very thrust of a spearman, and in journeying through distant lands, the very blow of a striker.",
          "It is not right that my reward should be disappointment, simply because I showed fear, and was not created with a warrior's constitution.",
          "Boldness is demanded only of one who is counted a true warrior, one named, from his very infancy, for leading whole armies.",
